00:01:31.908 --> 00:01:34.040
But before we get to the book itself,

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.440
you've written 16 books.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.210
And as a guy that just wrote one

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:40.390
and knows what it takes to write one,

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.900
how do you possibly not only
